  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Two Martin Honnen 2026-06-06 reports fixed.\n      Fix: streamed JSON output now quotes string values and honors indent='yes'. TransformStreamingCoreAsync begins sequence collection and routes through a shared FinalizeJsonOutput helper, instead of falling into CreateMapAsync's adaptive-mode no-accumulator branch which dropped quotes and ignored indent.\n      Fix: xsl:array body no longer leaks a stray empty [] at the end. CreateArrayAsync now redirects _sequenceAccumulator to the array under construction, so top-level body items become array members per XSLT 4.0 §22. Affects both streaming and non-streaming paths.\n      See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
